{"id":"80e1d458af53fea9","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-infinitary-proof.md","title":"Infinitary-proof","display":"df-infinitary-proof — Infinitary-proof","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-infinitary-proof","aliases":["72-df-infinitary-proof"],"display":"df-infinitary-proof — Infinitary-proof","depends_on":["[[72-df-proof-tree]]","[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","[[72-df-omega-rule]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III §3.1 and Figure1 print164–166/PDF176–178; Ch.IV §1.1 print210/PDF222 (ordinal background only)","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-infinitary-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-infinitary-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-infinitary-proof — Infinitary-proof"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"42b817f141b6851c\" href=\"?note=42b817f141b6851c\" title=\"72-df-omega-rule\">72-df-omega-rule</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III §3.1 and Figure1 print164–166/PDF176–178; Ch.IV §1.1 print210/PDF222 (ordinal background only)"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 为给定签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的演算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；对任意此类演算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WFProof}_{\\mathcal D}\">\\(\\mathrm{WFProof}_{\\mathcal D}\\)</span> 是该文件定义的良基证明树集合。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"42b817f141b6851c\" href=\"?note=42b817f141b6851c\" title=\"72-df-omega-rule\">72-df-omega-rule</a>；演算加规则集的运算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_\\omega:=\\mathcal C+\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal C_\\omega:=\\mathcal C+\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma}(\\mathcal C):=\\mathrm{WFProof}_{\\mathcal C_\\omega}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma}(\\mathcal C):=\\mathrm{WFProof}_{\\mathcal C_\\omega}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>实际节点局部合法、孩子序号和良基性由通用定义同时保证。原式S∪Omega把演算元组与规则集混并，现通过+修改规则分量。允许不使用ω规则的有限证明；“无穷证明”指允许无穷规则的证明域。</p>\n<p>来源定位复核：第 III 章 §3.1 和 Figure 1 在印刷 pp.164–166 / PDF pp.176–178；原书是单侧、带自然数和树序数界的判断系统。本文件的定义是通用演算加抽象双侧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 规则后的良基证明树编码，保持可数前提结构，没有把它当作原书完整的序数赋值演算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-omega-rule","status":"resolved","id":"42b817f141b6851c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-omega-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 为给定签名，$\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle$ 为 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的演算，$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)$；对任意此类演算 $\\mathcal D$，$\\mathrm{WFProof}_{\\mathcal D}$ 是该文件定义的良基证明树集合。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-omega-rule","status":"resolved","id":"42b817f141b6851c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_\\Sigma$ 见 [[72-df-omega-rule]]；演算加规则集的运算 $+$ 见 [[72-df-gentzen-system]]；$\\mathcal C_\\omega:=\\mathcal C+\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_\\Sigma$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_\\Sigma$ 见 [[72-df-omega-rule]]；演算加规则集的运算 $+$ 见 [[72-df-gentzen-system]]；$\\mathcal C_\\omega:=\\mathcal C+\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_\\Sigma$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WFProof}_{\\mathcal D}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_\\omega:=\\mathcal C+\\widehat{\\Omega\\mathrm{Rule}}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma}(\\mathcal C):=\\mathrm{WFProof}_{\\mathcal C_\\omega}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1851,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-infinitary-proof|df-infinitary-proof — Infinitary-proof]]"},{"id":"f57c523092bba1d6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 与 $\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\infty,\\Sigma}(\\mathcal C)$ 见 [[72-df-infinitary-proof]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-infinitary-proof|df-infinitary-proof — Infinitary-proof]]"}],"outgoing":["81c9c855e009a6d4","c60a11e47ac58326","42b817f141b6851c"]}